thumbnails:
function(t,slot){
 const base=`Use case: ${slot==="hat"?"background-extraction":"stylized-concept"}. One square transparent-background 2D RPG inventory thumbnail for the ${t.title} equipment set. The attached rigging sheet is a REFERENCE for equipment design, palette and drawing style only. Thick smooth black outlines, simple flat colors and restrained cel shading exactly like that game art. Palette: ${t.palette}. Era/materials: ${t.era}. Center ONE entire isolated item, large and legible at 64px, occupying about 75 percent of the square with generous empty margin, no cropping. Real transparent alpha background, no checkerboard painted in, no background color, no cast shadow, no text, no border, no sparkles or particles. No character or body parts. `;
 const specific={
 hat:`Produce ONLY the exact headgear worn by the dog in the reference: ${t.hat}. Faithfully preserve its colors, shape, attachments and ornament. Remove the dog completely, including ALL yellow ears, fur, face and head; reconstruct the inside of the empty wearable headgear naturally. No separate floating pieces.`,
 ring:`Design ONE wearable finger RING for this set. Motif/materials: ${t.jewel}. A clearly visible circular ring band with open center, viewed at a readable three-quarter angle, with one compact themed signet/gem setting. Must look like a ring, not a pendant or earring. No hands.`,
 necklace:`Design ONE NECKLACE for this set. Motif/materials: ${t.jewel}. A complete loop of era-appropriate cord or chain, with one clear compact themed pendant attached at the bottom. Clearly show the whole chain loop. Must look like a necklace, not just a loose pendant. No neck or mannequin.`,
 earring:`Design ONE single EARRING for this set. Motif/materials: ${t.jewel}. A clearly visible ear hook or small hoop at top and one compact themed drop charm attached below it. One earring only, not a pair, no ear or head. Clearly distinguish from a finger ring and necklace.`
 };return base+specific[slot];
}
